<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<TestCaseEntity>
   <description>Verify if users can login successful. 

Steps:
- Click on 'Book Appointment' button to login
- Input username and password
- Click on 'Login' button

Expected result:
'Appointment' section is displayed after successful login</description>
   <name>TC1_Verify Successful Login (1)</name>
   <tag></tag>
   <comment>Story: Login to CURA system
Given that the user has valid login information
When he logins to CURA system
Then he should be able to login successfully</comment>
